       as src/app/icon.svg, copied because Android cannot read SVG. Keep them
       equal to that file. The 64-unit mark is scaled 1.125× into the middle
       of the 108dp canvas: its body spans 54dp and its rounded corners reach
       32.6dp from the centre, inside the 33dp circle every launcher mask keeps.
       Also the monochrome layer (Android 13 themed icons) and the splash mark.
-->
